{"step_index":240,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-05T19:38:55Z","thinking":"Focus is now on crafting a modern `style.css` file. Requirements encompass gradient headers, a glowing background, and glassmorphism cards, alongside full responsive design using mobile media queries. Specific styling will be added for several key UI elements, including tables, badges, grids, and a floating chat widget. This will also involve ensuring clean typography and a polished color palette.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":":root {\n    --primary: #2563eb;\n    --primary-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb 0%, #4f46e5 100%);\n    --primary-dark: #1d4ed8;\n    --primary-light: #60a5fa;\n    --secondary: #0f172a;\n    --accent: #10b981;\n    --danger: #ef4444;\n    --warning: #f59e0b;\n    --bg-main: #f8fafc;\n    --card-bg: #ffffff;\n    --text-main: #0f172a;\n    --text-muted: #64748b;\n    --border: #e2e8f0;\n    --border-dark: #cbd5e1;\n    --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n    --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);\n    --shadow-lg: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 4px 6px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n    --shadow-xl: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);\n}\n\n* {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\n}\n\nbody {\n    background-color: var(--bg-main);\n    color: var(--text-main);\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    overflow-x: hidden;\n}\n\n.font-mono {\n    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace !important;\n}\n\n/* Announcement Header */\n.top-announcement {\n    background: #0f172a;\n    color: #94a3b8;\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 0.4rem 1rem;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n}\n\n.top-announcement strong {\n    color: #38bdf8;\n}\n\n/* Navbar */\n.navbar {\n    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n    position: sticky;\n    top: 0;\n    z-index: 100;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n}\n\n.nav-container {\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n}\n\n.nav-brand {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.75rem;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    color: white;\n}\n\n.brand-logo {\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #6366f1);\n    width: 40px;\n    height: 40px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);\n}\n\n.brand-title {\n    font-size: 1.15rem;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n    display: block;\n}\n\n.brand-subtitle {\n    font-size: 0.7rem;\n    color: #94a3b8;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n    display: block;\n}\n\n.nav-menu {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 1.5rem;\n}\n\n.nav-link {\n    color: #cbd5e1;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    transition: color 0.2s;\n}\n\n.nav-link:hover, .nav-link.active {\n    color: #38bdf8;\n}\n\n.nav-auth {\n    margin-left: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.nav-toggle {\n    display: none;\n    background: none;\n    border: none;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 5px;\n}\n\n.nav-toggle span {\n    display: block;\n    width: 24px;\n    height: 2px;\n    background: white;\n}\n\n/* Hero Section */\n.hero-section {\n    position: relative;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% -20%, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 100%);\n    color: white;\n    padding: 4.5rem 1.5rem 5.5rem;\n    text-align: center;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.hero-bg-glow {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 20%;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n    width: 600px;\n    height: 300px;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.25) 0%, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0) 70%);\n    pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.hero-content {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n    max-width: 900px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n.hero-badge {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n    background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.35);\n    padding: 0.35rem 1rem;\n    border-radius: 9999px;\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #60a5fa;\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n}\n\n.pulse-dot {\n    width: 8px;\n    height: 8px;\n    background: #10b981;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 8px #10b981;\n    animation: pulse 2s infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes pulse {\n    0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }\n    50% { transform: scale(1.3); opacity: 0.6; }\n}\n\n.hero-title {\n    font-size: 3rem;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n}\n\n.text-gradient {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #60a5fa 0%, #a78bfa 100%);\n    -webkit-background-clip: text;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n}\n\n.hero-description {\n    font-size: 1.15rem;\n    color: #94a3b8;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    max-width: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;\n}\n\n/* Search Card */\n.search-box-wrapper {\n    max-width: 750px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n.search-card {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98);\n    color: var(--text-main);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 2rem;\n    box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n    text-align: left;\n}\n\n.search-card-header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.search-label {\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #1e293b;\n}\n\n.search-hint {\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    color: #64748b;\n}\n\n.input-group {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 0.75rem;\n    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n}\n\n.input-control {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding: 0.9rem 1.25rem;\n    border: 2px solid var(--border);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    outline: none;\n    transition: all 0.2s;\n    background: #f8fafc;\n}\n\n.input-control:focus {\n    border-color: var(--primary);\n    background: #ffffff;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.1);\n}\n\n.btn-primary {\n    background: var(--primary-gradient);\n    color: white;\n    padding: 0.9rem 1.75rem;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all 0.2s;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.25);\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n    text-decoration: none;\n}\n\n.btn-primary:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-1px);\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.35);\n}\n\n.btn-primary.btn-sm {\n    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n}\n\n.btn-outline {\n    background: transparent;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-dark);\n    color: #334155;\n    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all 0.2s;\n}\n\n.btn-outline:hover {\n    background: #f1f5f9;\n    border-color: #94a3b8;\n}\n\n.btn-outline.btn-sm {\n    padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n}\n\n/* Quick Test Bar */\n.quick-test-bar {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n}\n\n.quick-test-label {\n    color: #64748b;\n    font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.chip-btn {\n    padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    font-size: 0.78rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    border: none;\n    transition: all 0.2s;\n}\n\n.chip-success {\n    background: #dcfce7;\n    color: #15803d;\n    border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;\n}\n\n.chip-success:hover {\n    background: #bbf7d0;\n}\n\n.chip-danger {\n    background: #fee2e2;\n    color: #b91c1c;\n    border: 1px solid #fecaca;\n}\n\n.chip-danger:hover {\n    background: #fecaca;\n}\n\n.chip-neutral {\n    background: #f1f5f9;\n    color: #475569;\n    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\n}\n\n.chip-neutral:hover {\n    background: #e2e8f0;\n}\n\n/* Loading Box */\n.loading-box {\n    margin: 2rem auto;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #93c5fd;\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n}\n\n.spinner {\n    width: 36px;\n    height: 36px;\n    border: 4px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n    border-top-color: #60a5fa;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    animation: spin 0.8s linear infinite;\n    margin: 0 auto 0.75rem;\n}\n\n@keyframes spin {\n    to { transform: rotate(360deg); }\n}\n\n/* Result Card */\n.result-card {\n    background: white;\n    color: var(--text-main);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 2.25rem;\n    box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n    border-left: 8px solid var(--accent);\n    margin-top: 2rem;\n    text-align: left;\n    animation: slideUp 0.3s ease-out;\n}\n\n@keyframes slideUp {\n    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); }\n    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n}\n\n.result-header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    padding-bottom: 1.25rem;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n}\n\n.result-eyebrow {\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n    color: #64748b;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.result-title {\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #0f172a;\n}\n\n.result-desc {\n    color: #475569;\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    margin-top: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.status-badge {\n    padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;\n    border-radius: 9999px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.status-badge-success {\n    background: #dcfce7;\n    color: #15803d;\n    border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;\n}\n\n.status-badge-danger {\n    background: #fee2e2;\n    color: #b91c1c;\n    border: 1px solid #fecaca;\n}\n\n.status-badge-warning {\n    background: #fef3c7;\n    color: #b45309;\n    border: 1px solid #fde68a;\n}\n\n.credential-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));\n    gap: 1.25rem;\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n}\n\n.data-card {\n    background: #f8fafc;\n    padding: 1rem;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n\n.data-label {\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n    color: #64748b;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.data-value {\n    font-size: 1.05rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #0f172a;\n    display: block;\n}\n\n/* Crypto Proof Box */\n.crypto-proof-box {\n    background: #0f172a;\n    color: white;\n    padding: 1.25rem;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n}\n\n.proof-header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #94a3b8;\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.verified-tag {\n    color: #4ade80;\n}\n\n.hash-code {\n    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    color: #38bdf8;\n    word-break: break-all;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\n/* AI Assessment Box */\n.ai-assessment-box {\n    background: #eff6ff;\n    border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 1.25rem;\n    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n}\n\n.ai-box-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.75rem;\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.ai-icon {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n}\n\n.ai-badge {\n    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-left: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.ai-badge-low {\n    background: #dcfce7;\n    color: #15803d;\n}\n\n.ai-badge-critical {\n    background: #fee2e2;\n    color: #b91c1c;\n}\n\n.ai-box-text {\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    color: #1e3a8a;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\n.result-footer {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n    color: #64748b;\n    padding-top: 1rem;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n\n/* Stats Section */\n.stats-section {\n    background: white;\n    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n\n.stats-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));\n    gap: 1.5rem;\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n.stat-card {\n    background: #f8fafc;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    padding: 1.75rem;\n    text-align: center;\n    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;\n}\n\n.stat-card:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-3px);\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\n}\n\n.stat-icon {\n    font-size: 2rem;\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.stat-number {\n    font-size: 2.25rem;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #0f172a;\n    line-height: 1;\n    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\n}\n\n.stat-title {\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #334155;\n    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;\n}\n\n.stat-sub {\n    font-size: 0.78rem;\n    color: #64748b;\n}\n\n/* How It Works Section */\n.how-it-works-section {\n    padding: 4.5rem 1.5rem;\n    background: #f8fafc;\n}\n\n.section-header {\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 700px;\n    margin: 0 auto 3rem;\n}\n\n.section-tag {\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: var(--primary);\n    background: #eff6ff;\n   